{"title": "The Gate's Pub Crawl Guide", "pageid": 25325, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Gate's_Pub_Crawl_Guide", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Generic_G_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_G_Image.png.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Gate's Pub Crawl Guide image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_G_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>The Gate's Pub Crawl Guide</b> is a book featuring drinking establishments in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author: unknown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: unknown</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace#Ballroom\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace Ballroom</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1274&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1012</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This excerpt from The Gate's Pub Crawl Guide suggests that more than one drink was imbibed during its writing.]\n</p><p><br>\nEveryone goes on about the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong</a> - how iconic it is. How 'interesting' its ghost is. Well, BOO I say! I wish to have music! DRAMA! And I can't with a spirit jealous enough to stop any but itself performing.\n</p><p><br>\nTherefore, it is with stupendous delight that I suggest many OTHER glorious boozing establishments!\n</p><p><br>\nTake the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>, where you can watch <a href=\"/wiki/Syllabub_Fran\" title=\"Syllabub Fran\">Shimmer the Siren</a> dazzle the crowd, or simply enjoy its swashbuckling patrons sing shanties and beat one another into oblivion.\n</p><p><br>\nOr mayhaps you fancy a delightful venue with live music, and the most sour waitstaff you've ever met. If so, the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Singing_Lute\" title=\"The Singing Lute\">Singing Lute</a> is for you! Tucked away by the\nharbour, it's perfect for a romantic evening. If nothing else, <a href=\"/wiki/Henk\" title=\"Henk\">Henk's</a> delightful demeanour will make you grateful for your beloved.\n</p><p><br>\nHowever, there remains another watering-hole. One that only the most daring, the most courageous of patrons go! Should you wish to test your mettle, and rub shoulders with the city's secret underbelly, I can only tell you this.\n</p><p><br>\nEnjoy the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a>...\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1322/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19538/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9219/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818206/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.971      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   30.971      1 -total\n 31.32%    9.701      6 Template:Icon_text\n 23.12%    7.161     13 Template:Trim\n 21.31%    6.599      1 Template:Main_only\n 17.03%    5.274      2 Template:Icon_link\n 14.28%    4.423      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.17%    4.389      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.27%    4.110      1 Template:Books\n 11.56%    3.579      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:25325-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714233000 and revision id 397153. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}